  "correction_note": {
    "root_cause_location": "Both analysis code/saved summary (confirmation_results.json) and prior narrative summary",
    "mechanism": "phase5_stats.exact_mcnemar_test() rounded p_value to 10 decimal places, truncating 2/2^36 (~2.910e-11 for C vs B) and 2/2^42 (~4.547e-13 for C vs A) to 0.0. common.holm_bonferroni_adjust() sorted on those rounded 0.0 values in insertion order (reversing the Holm multipliers for C_vs_B_primary [assigned 3] and C_vs_A_secondary [assigned 2]) and also rounded adjusted p-values to 10 decimals (producing 0.0 in confirmation_results.json).",
    "remediation": "Original outputs/confirmation_results.json, outputs/confirmation_episodes.jsonl, frozen_plan.json, freeze_lock.json, and phase5_stats.py are preserved unchanged. Full-precision exact McNemar p-values and corrected Holm-Bonferroni adjustments are computed and recorded here."
